=== 4. API GATEWAY: punto de entrada unico (puerto 8443), enruta por canal via Eureka ===
--- Tabla de rutas vigente (/actuator/gateway/routes) ---
{"route_id":"canal-web","uri":"lb://bff-web","predicate":"Paths: [/api/web/**], match trailing slash: true"}
{"route_id":"canal-movil","uri":"lb://bff-mobile","predicate":"Paths: [/api/mobile/**], match trailing slash: true"}
{"route_id":"canal-cajero","uri":"lb://bff-atm","predicate":"Paths: [/api/atm/**], match trailing slash: true"}
--- Login del canal WEB a traves del gateway (notese el encabezado X-Banco-XYZ-Gateway) ---
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
X-Banco-XYZ-Gateway: api-gateway
GET https://127.0.0.1:8443/api/web/cuentas/101 (canal web via gateway)            -> HTTP 200 (se espera 200)
GET https://127.0.0.1:8443/api/mobile/cuentas/101/resumen (canal movil via gateway) -> HTTP 200 (se espera 200)
POST https://127.0.0.1:8443/api/atm/sesion (canal cajero via gateway)                -> HTTP 200 (se espera 200)
GET https://127.0.0.1:8443/internal/cuentas (los microservicios NO tienen ruta en el gateway) -> HTTP 404 (se espera 404)

